Proposed changes, each applying prior to the Trigger Date:
- remove the 6.05(a)(ix)(A) RP basket;
- remove the 6.05(b)(iv) RDP basket;
- no Available Equity Amount RPs/RDPs, except RDPs on Parent Convertible Notes;
- 6.01(e) general debt basket ($195MM / 11.25%) must be unsecured;
- 6.09(k) designated non-cash consideration (DNCC) basket reduced to the greater of $25MM and the corresponding percentage of Total Assets;
- 6.04(d), (e) and (j) investment baskets ($85MM/5%, $45MM/2.5%, $75MM/4%) kept, with a new $150MM shared cap.
Also adds a new $5MM 6.02 cash-collateral lien basket.

